            "detailed_description": "<h1>INTRODUCING: KING OF THE CASTLE</h1><p></p><br><h1>Join the Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De que serve ter amigos se não for para jogar golfe... With Your Friends? Vale tudo nestes campos de minigolfe e a ação é rápida e entusiasmante para um máximo de 12 jogadores em simultâneo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caraterísticas principais:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multijogador de 12 jogadores!</strong> Certifica-te de que as tuas capacidades estão a par dos 11 golfistas que podes enfrentar no multijogador online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/3cf00749c2bb4c15cd2e53f2157ba3ae.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/3cf00749c2bb4c15cd2e53f2157ba3ae.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/3cf00749c2bb4c15cd2e53f2157ba3ae.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campos temáticos!</strong>  Joga em campos com mecânicas e buracos únicos, torna-te um profissional no campo dos piratas, faz um albatroz no campo com o tema ancestral e entra num campo de batalha que alude a um certo jogo de minhocas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/c09bdb25f0022a3679ca9e6087a5a0c4.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/c09bdb25f0022a3679ca9e6087a5a0c4.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/c09bdb25f0022a3679ca9e6087a5a0c4.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reforços!</strong>  Ganha vantagem sobre os teus amigos prendendo a bola deles em mel, congelando-a ou transformando-a num cubo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/a2680637bbebe730e74915eacc8f6c9b.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/a2680637bbebe730e74915eacc8f6c9b.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/a2680637bbebe730e74915eacc8f6c9b.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Três modos de jogo!</strong> Joga minigolfe clássico, dá tacadas para encestar a bola ou troca o buraco por uma baliza de hóquei.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/046788217487be82a3141124b249f680.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/046788217487be82a3141124b249f680.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/046788217487be82a3141124b249f680.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Editor de níveis!</strong> Dá um toque pessoal ao jogo ao criar, partilhar e jogar nos teus próprios campos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/b2637fd685f8d228a9f4d83044cb6fc1.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/b2637fd685f8d228a9f4d83044cb6fc1.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/b2637fd685f8d228a9f4d83044cb6fc1.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalizações!</strong> Transforma o campo de golfe numa passarela de moda para a tua bola, dando-lhe chapéus, skins e rastos cheios de estilo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/54d89a9ee051c3a58c5104b47c9babb1.poster.avif?t=1789740480\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/54d89a9ee051c3a58c5104b47c9babb1.webm?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431240/extras/54d89a9ee051c3a58c5104b47c9babb1.mp4?t=1789740480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
