                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Golf With Your Friends is literally described in the title. The game has many maps and different mechanics which adds variety into this game. Many of the holes can be done in hole-in-one as well, which makes it interesting for the min-maxers. The customisations are really sick as well and you get most of them for free by just finishing the maps. I really made a lot of memories playing this game and its definitely a fun party game with friends!",
